## Recommended citation

When reusing this material, credit AIDD-compare contributors, link to the
source and the CC BY 4.0 license, and indicate any changes as required by
the license.

Assessments and classifications involve interpretation. To help readers
identify the material cited, we recommend also including its version or
commit and your access date. This recommendation is not an additional
license condition.

